# Qwen3-TTS 0.1.1 production-inference closure for CPython 3.12.12 on
# macOS 12+ ARM64, built from official revision
# 022e286b98fbec7e1e916cb940cdf532cd9f488e.
#
# The pinned upstream package fixes Transformers and Accelerate but leaves its
# remaining dependencies floating. These reviewed top-level versions resolve
# to the complete hashed wheel lock. Gradio is included because it is declared
# by qwen-tts metadata even though Whoopy runs the JSON-lines worker rather than
# Qwen's development Web UI. Model and speech-tokenizer checkpoints remain
# separate verified model-pack artifacts and are never included here.

